                <pb facs="0654" n="536" sameAs="frus:frus1928v02/pg536"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.51/5096: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Minister in China</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">MacMurray</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1928-11-15T18:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">November 15,
                                1928—6 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>385. Your 818, November 8, 7 p.m. Department is considering your proposed text of
                    a caveat. Take no action thereon until further instructed.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Kellogg</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
